TI  - Pathogenicity virulence of Beauveria spp. and biosafety of the BbMQ strain on adult ectoparasitic beetles, Dastarcus helophoroides Fairmaire (Coleoptera: Colydiidae).
PG  - 1077473
LID - 10.3389/fvets.2023.1077473 [doi]
